# House Hlaalu: the stronghold, second stage (HH_Stronghold), Dondos Driler, Balmora.
# Dondos on "egg mining" (110), "Shurdan-Raplay" (120) and "recruit some miners" (130); the blighted kwama queen
# of the Shurdan-Raplay Egg Mine cured (her script, kwamaQueenShurdan: 140; RemoveSpell of her Ash-chancre stands in
# for the player's Cure Blight); the Gnisis egg miner Ilasour Tansumiran hired ("I need miners in the
# Shurdan-Raplay mine." 1: 150); Dondos (170) starts Strong_Build2_H, 6 days (200).
# PositionCell + `approach` stand in for the travel; `rest` for the days the builders take.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case hh_stronghold_mine
run
player->PositionCell 368 -276 16 0 "Balmora, Hlaalu Council Manor"
until 300 GetPCCell "Balmora, Hlaalu Council Manor" == 1
approach 05C0F40D
talk dondos driler
ask stronghold
ask egg mining
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Stronghold == 110
ask Shurdan-Raplay
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Stronghold == 120
ask recruit some miners
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Stronghold == 130
bye
run
player->PositionCell -341 5180 -1393 0 "Shurdan-Raplay Egg Mine"
until 300 GetPCCell "Shurdan-Raplay Egg Mine" == 1
run
"kwama queen_shurdan"->RemoveSpell "ash-chancre"
until 300 GetJournalIndex HH_Stronghold >= 140
run
player->PositionCell -158 -87 -174 0 "Gnisis, Tansumiran Cave Dwelling"
until 300 GetPCCell "Gnisis, Tansumiran Cave Dwelling" == 1
approach 05B10EAD
talk ilasour tansumiran
ask recruit some miners
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Stronghold == 150
bye
run
player->PositionCell 368 -276 16 0 "Balmora, Hlaalu Council Manor"
until 300 GetPCCell "Balmora, Hlaalu Council Manor" == 1
approach 05C0F40D
talk dondos driler
ask stronghold
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Stronghold == 170
bye
rest 10x24 - GetJournalIndex HH_Stronghold >= 200
end

# Third stage (House Father): Dondos wants the bandits that prey on the stronghold dealt with ("guard against
# bandits": 210); Flaenia Amiulusus at the Balmora Fighters Guild hires out Fjorgeir ("Pay 1000 gold." 1: 220), who
# guards the stronghold ("Guard this spot." 2); the bandit leader Maros Gimayn in Zainsipilu killed; Dondos (270)
# starts Strong_Build3_H, 6 days (300).
case hh_stronghold_guard
approach 05C0F40D
talk dondos driler
ask stronghold
ask guard against bandits
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Stronghold == 210
bye
run
player->PositionCell 402 597 -361 0 "Balmora, Guild of Fighters"
until 300 GetPCCell "Balmora, Guild of Fighters" == 1
approach 0567BA03
talk flaenia amiulusus
ask guard against bandits
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Stronghold == 220
bye
run
player->Position -35037 -35304 1803 0
until 300 player->GetDistance fjorgeir < 2000
approach 058675E4
talk fjorgeir
ask guard against bandits
ask fight together
choose 2
bye
defend
run
player->PositionCell -1588 -694 396 0 "Zainsipilu"
until 300 GetPCCell "Zainsipilu" == 1
approach 05548F17
console 05548F17.kill
wait 60
run
player->PositionCell 368 -276 16 0 "Balmora, Hlaalu Council Manor"
until 300 GetPCCell "Balmora, Hlaalu Council Manor" == 1
approach 05C0F40D
talk dondos driler
ask guard against bandits
expect GetJournalIndex HH_Stronghold == 270
bye
rest 10x24 - GetJournalIndex HH_Stronghold >= 300
end
